    "title": "SLC weekend events: Jordan Clarkson closet sale and 801 Day - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Salt Lake City is buzzing with reasons to get out of the house this weekend. 🛍️ Jordan Clarkson moving sale : The former Jazz guard is offloading more than 1,000 discounted items from his closet after joining the New York Knicks. When: Noon-8pm; Friday-Sunday Where: Thrifthood (57 W. 200 South) 🎉 801 Day : Celebrate Salt Lake City with food trucks, live music and a beer garden from Second Summit Hard Cider. 🛼 Pacific Islander Skate Night : Join and honor Utah's Pacific Islander community with skating, a live DJ set, Polynesian food and more. When: 6pm-10pm Friday Where: Millcreek Common Admission: Free 🍿 Summer Film Series : Watch the documentary \"Move Ya Body: The Birth of House\" at the park. RSVP for free . 🇲🇽 Mexican Food Festival : Indulge in one of the world's best cuisines at this festival hosted by the Mexican Consulate and Artes de México en Utah .",
